libigloo
------------------------------------------
libigloo is a generic C framework. It is developed and used by the Icecast
project.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libigloo-devel-0.9.5-1bl2
  libigloo0-0.9.5-1bl2
  librhash0-1.4.6-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  librhash-devel-1.4.6-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://gitlab.xiph.org/xiph/icecast-libigloo

Canonical download:
  https://downloads.xiph.org/releases/igloo/libigloo-0.9.5.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libigloo-0.9.5-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libigloo-0.9.5-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libigloo-0.9.5-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libigloo-0.9.5-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libigloo0-0.9.5-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libigloo-devel-0.9.5-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libigloo)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libigloo.README
  /usr/share/doc/libigloo/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libigloo/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/libigloo/README

(libigloo0)
  /usr/bin/cygigloo-0.dll

(libigloo-devel)
  /usr/include/igloo/config.h
  /usr/include/igloo/cs.h
